               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Hydrology: Rocks: physical properties; Physical Properties of Rocks: Magnetic and electrical properties; Physical Properties of Rocks: Permeability and porosity; Physical Properties of Rocks: Transport properties; Mineral Physics: Electrical properties</rdf:li>
